===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computer graphics}} The [[three-dimensional]] [[analogue]] of a pixel; a [[volume]] [[element]] representing some [[numerical]] [[quantity]], such as the [[colour]], of a [[point]] in three-dimensional [[space]], used in the [[visualisation]] and [[analysis]] of three-dimensional (especially [[scientific]] and [[medical]]) data.

